WEBVTT

00:01.380 --> 00:02.690
That can't be!

00:03.030 --> 00:06.520
Cain, were you really with the first king?

00:06.520 --> 00:10.490
Yes. He created a separate world,

00:10.490 --> 00:13.740
and he's been living there 
as its God of Creation.

00:14.110 --> 00:17.200
How can that be? It's impossible!

00:17.860 --> 00:21.210
Also, he gave me this.

00:21.210 --> 00:23.140
Th-That's...

00:23.140 --> 00:26.640
The so-called "katana" that the 
first king is said to have used?!

00:29.100 --> 00:32.350
I see... You really did see him...

00:33.370 --> 00:38.300
And it says in this letter that 
the first king trained you?

00:38.700 --> 00:42.220
Yes, and it was incredibly tough training!

00:42.220 --> 00:46.190
He made me traverse a forest that 
was teeming with vicious monsters,

00:46.190 --> 00:49.650
fight mock battles until 
I collapsed every single day...

00:49.930 --> 00:53.360
I was forced to train day and night.

00:53.590 --> 00:55.130
For five years!

00:55.130 --> 00:56.570
F-Five years?!

00:56.570 --> 00:59.810
Cain, what did you just say?!

00:59.810 --> 01:00.240
Huh?

01:00.620 --> 01:03.450
How could it have been five years?!

01:03.450 --> 01:04.410
Oops!

01:05.840 --> 01:09.880
You truly are amusing, Cain, 
even after five years.

01:10.300 --> 01:15.340
By the way, while you were gone, a notice 
came in from the adventurers' guild.

01:15.340 --> 01:15.970
Huh?

01:16.350 --> 01:20.350
You forgot to accept the quest 
needed to advance to Rank A.

01:20.670 --> 01:24.020
If you don't act on it, 
your registration will be canceled.

01:24.020 --> 01:26.020
What?!

01:27.480 --> 01:30.310
<i>I'm a reincarnated noble who came back 
after some off-the-charts training</i>

01:30.310 --> 01:34.930
<i>to learn that my A-rank registration 
was in danger of cancellation.</i>

01:34.930 --> 01:40.040
<i>But that careless part of 
me hasn't changed a bit.</i>

01:51.170 --> 01:54.050
The Aristocrat's
<b>Otherworldly Adventure:
Serving Gods Who Go Too Far</b>

03:11.480 --> 03:15.210
"The Trials of an A-Rank Adventurer"

03:11.770 --> 03:13.010
Guild Master,

03:13.010 --> 03:15.210
Master Cain is here to see you.

03:15.210 --> 03:18.920
Um, what's all this about my 
registration being canceled?!

03:19.250 --> 03:23.010
I've been worried since you haven't 
come by to accept any quests.

03:23.010 --> 03:27.560
I'm sorry. I haven't had many free days 
since starting at the academy.

03:27.560 --> 03:29.640
Plus, various other things happened...

03:29.640 --> 03:31.620
You stayed somewhere unannounced, did you?

03:31.620 --> 03:33.980
Tijuana was so sad you were gone.

03:34.300 --> 03:38.190
She said since she couldn't fight mock battles,
 her bottled-up love might explode.

03:39.720 --> 03:43.160
Anyway, um... About you 
canceling my registration...

03:43.400 --> 03:45.180
When I promoted you to A-rank,

03:45.180 --> 03:48.700
I told you there was a quest 
you needed to complete, didn't I?

03:49.230 --> 03:51.090
The time limit on it is almost up.

03:51.090 --> 03:54.650
You need to hurry, or your guild 
registration will be canceled.

03:54.650 --> 03:56.630
Please don't do that!

03:56.920 --> 03:59.460
So you'll accept the quest right away, then?

03:59.900 --> 04:01.920
Huh? Right now?

04:02.150 --> 04:03.960
Or should I cancel your registration?

04:03.960 --> 04:05.010
Please let me do it!

04:05.390 --> 04:08.720
As I told you before, I need 
you to subjugate some bandits.

04:08.720 --> 04:11.930
And all I need to do is capture them, right?

04:12.180 --> 04:17.150
The bandits in question show up on the 
route from Gracia to the royal capital.

04:17.150 --> 04:20.780
They're a group of ten or so. 
Think you can handle it?

04:20.780 --> 04:22.610
Well, I guess it's silly to ask that, huh?

04:22.920 --> 04:24.700
You're the strongest guy in the capital.

04:26.250 --> 04:27.660
Well, I'll look into it, anyway.

04:28.060 --> 04:29.050
Please do.

04:35.690 --> 04:36.440
Fly!

04:42.730 --> 04:43.840
Is that...

04:46.330 --> 04:47.510
Found them!

04:48.760 --> 04:49.930
Let me help you!

04:49.930 --> 04:51.050
Cain?

04:51.360 --> 04:52.020
Huh?

04:52.300 --> 04:53.730
Maestra Nina?!

04:53.960 --> 04:57.700
And Sabinos... and Maestra Millie?!

04:58.190 --> 04:59.020
You're hurt!

04:59.260 --> 05:00.110
Maestra!

05:00.110 --> 05:00.940
Cain!

05:01.910 --> 05:03.280
You little brat!

05:03.280 --> 05:04.470
High Heal!

05:05.240 --> 05:08.700
Thanks. I guess there were 
a few too many for us.

05:08.700 --> 05:11.340
And how's one more on 
your side gonna help you?

05:11.340 --> 05:15.050
Little kids should just stay home
 suckling on their mommy's teat!

05:16.330 --> 05:18.710
Is that all you'd like to say?

05:19.140 --> 05:22.600
You'll pay dearly for 
injuring Maestra Millie.

05:22.600 --> 05:24.630
Say that again, brat!

05:25.510 --> 05:26.730
Boost!

05:29.640 --> 05:32.140
Damn you!

05:34.420 --> 05:35.310
Hey, you!

05:39.610 --> 05:40.900
Get him!

05:47.800 --> 05:50.450
Holding back really is hard.

05:50.800 --> 05:51.450
Isn't it?

05:51.450 --> 05:52.490
Scary!

05:53.510 --> 05:56.210
Thank you so much, Master Cain.

05:56.210 --> 05:58.870
Not at all. I'm just glad you're all safe.

05:59.120 --> 06:01.460
What are you doing out here, though?

06:01.460 --> 06:04.420
I accepted a subjugation 
quest from the guild!

06:04.680 --> 06:06.120
Accepted a...

06:06.120 --> 06:09.500
Wait a minute! 
You're still twelve, aren't you?!

06:09.500 --> 06:11.750
Didn't you only just 
register with the guild?!

06:11.750 --> 06:15.600
Subjugation quests are only for 
those with C-rank or higher...

06:16.310 --> 06:18.190
A-rank?!

06:18.190 --> 06:21.560
Cain, you skipped C- and B-rank?!

06:19.540 --> 06:21.020
<b>C-rank</b>

06:20.000 --> 06:21.330
<b>B-rank</b>

06:21.980 --> 06:24.290
You're A-rank already?!

06:24.290 --> 06:25.380
Yep!

06:25.380 --> 06:29.360
Some things happened, and I got 
a compulsory promotion to A-rank.

06:29.710 --> 06:31.490
That's a really big deal, isn't it?

06:31.830 --> 06:32.970
Of course it is!

06:32.970 --> 06:36.250
Oh... So that's how he took 
out the bandits so easily.

06:36.860 --> 06:41.460
Still, it's great that they're captured, 
but what do we do with them?

06:41.690 --> 06:43.670
No need to worry about that!

06:43.670 --> 06:46.580
I'm A-rank, after all!

06:53.000 --> 06:55.390
Do they feel no shame?

06:55.390 --> 06:57.550
Those boys are already done for.

07:01.960 --> 07:03.700
Thank you very much.

07:03.700 --> 07:05.610
Please escort them safely home, as well.

07:07.030 --> 07:07.860
Dad!

07:08.820 --> 07:10.920
Master Cain is with you?

07:10.920 --> 07:12.280
Hi, Parma.

07:13.730 --> 07:15.610
What in the world is this?!

07:15.610 --> 07:19.210
Bandits I captured for a quest 
from the adventurers' guild.

07:19.550 --> 07:23.080
He saved us when we were attacked 
on the way to the capital.

07:23.470 --> 07:24.920
You did that? Really?

07:24.920 --> 07:29.690
Well, the guys attacking him just happened 
to be the ones I needed for the quest.

07:29.690 --> 07:33.020
We're off school today,
and you still had to work so hard.

07:33.020 --> 07:35.390
I'm sure you have baron work to do, too.

07:35.990 --> 07:37.100
Baron?!

07:37.770 --> 07:39.610
Cain, you're a baron now?

07:39.610 --> 07:40.470
Well, yeah...

07:40.470 --> 07:43.440
Then I shouldn't talk to you like 
an old friend anymore, should I?

07:43.440 --> 07:45.930
I have to call you Baron Cain!

07:46.310 --> 07:47.410
You, too, Nina!

07:47.410 --> 07:48.600
He's a gold digger's dream.

07:48.600 --> 07:50.730
Huh? Please don't do that.

07:50.730 --> 07:53.130
You two are still my maestras.

07:53.130 --> 07:56.200
You can just call me "Cain," as usual.

07:56.200 --> 07:58.510
Really? We appreciate that!

07:58.510 --> 08:00.450
That's what we'll do, then.

08:00.450 --> 08:03.830
Still, you really grew up 
in just a few years, huh?

08:03.830 --> 08:06.610
You're practically an adult now!

08:08.730 --> 08:10.700
Please stop playing around!

08:10.700 --> 08:13.450
I need to go report to the guild now!

08:13.450 --> 08:15.600
Bye, Parma! See you at school!

08:15.600 --> 08:17.070
Hey! Cain!

08:17.070 --> 08:20.770
We'll go with you! Wait!

08:23.550 --> 08:24.520
Here you go.

08:24.520 --> 08:28.550
I also got Sabinos's testimony 
confirming the subjugation.

08:28.550 --> 08:31.110
The bandits are being held 
in a carriage out front.

08:31.110 --> 08:33.840
What?! You finished it already?

08:33.840 --> 08:37.110
I'll let the guild master 
know right away, then.

08:37.110 --> 08:38.460
Please do!

08:38.460 --> 08:39.990
Hey, hey, hey!

08:39.990 --> 08:42.790
If it isn't Millie!

08:43.770 --> 08:46.420
Let me show you around the capital.

08:46.420 --> 08:48.980
Hmph. You guys again, huh?

08:48.980 --> 08:50.250
Not interested.

08:50.250 --> 08:52.520
Aw, why not?

08:52.520 --> 08:54.470
Come hang out for a while!

08:54.830 --> 08:57.780
Would you leave them alone 
and go away, please?

08:58.090 --> 09:00.430
Who the hell are... Wait...

09:04.050 --> 09:06.430
You're that kid from before!

09:08.170 --> 09:10.120
Hey, hey, hey, hey.

09:10.120 --> 09:13.030
I wondered who was emitting 
such a murderous aura.

09:13.030 --> 09:14.150
So it's you, Cain.

09:14.910 --> 09:15.860
Claude!

09:16.820 --> 09:18.360
It's him!

09:19.150 --> 09:22.430
Most adventurers would have a 
tough time with a group like that.

09:22.430 --> 09:24.800
Well, they were bothering my friends!

09:24.800 --> 09:27.480
Your friends? Who?

09:27.480 --> 09:29.590
That'd be us, bro!

09:29.590 --> 09:31.550
Wait, your "friends" are...

09:31.830 --> 09:33.880
Millie and Nina?!

09:33.880 --> 09:38.050
What? How do you two know my maestras?

09:38.050 --> 09:39.680
Your maestras?

09:39.900 --> 09:41.970
Millie is my kid sister.

09:41.970 --> 09:43.270
What?!

09:43.530 --> 09:48.160
I'm more surprised that you know them. How?

09:48.160 --> 09:53.300
How? Nina and I were Cain's tutors 
starting when he was five.

09:53.300 --> 09:56.180
Oh, so that's why he called you his maestras.

09:56.570 --> 09:59.360
I remember you mentioning 
that in a letter now.

10:00.860 --> 10:03.740
Awesome! Talk about a coincidence!

10:03.740 --> 10:06.210
All right! This calls for drinks—

10:07.450 --> 10:11.610
You'll turn anything into an excuse to drink.

10:11.610 --> 10:13.800
But... it's a happy occasion.

10:14.250 --> 10:16.140
Cheers!

10:16.650 --> 10:19.360
Why were you guys all together today?

10:19.360 --> 10:24.140
Because Cain showed up while 
we were on an escort mission,

10:24.140 --> 10:28.310
and when bandits showed up, he clobbered 
them! Wham, wham, wham, wham!

10:28.570 --> 10:30.520
Cain is A-rank already.

10:30.520 --> 10:31.480
Huh?!

10:32.240 --> 10:34.410
How did you get to A-rank so quickly?

10:34.410 --> 10:36.610
Didn't you just register days ago?

10:37.130 --> 10:41.490
Though, as strong as you are, 
I shouldn't be surprised.

10:41.490 --> 10:45.290
You were the only student who really 
kept up with me during the exams, too.

10:45.560 --> 10:49.480
What?! You actually kept up with my brother?!

10:49.480 --> 10:54.840
But he got to A-rank using his 
sword alone, without using magic!

10:55.300 --> 10:57.450
And you were a match for him?

10:57.450 --> 11:00.870
Cain isn't just some margrave's son.

11:00.870 --> 11:04.160
He's already been appointed 
his own domain as a baron.

11:04.490 --> 11:05.600
He's a gold digger's dream.

11:05.600 --> 11:07.250
A baron?!

11:07.250 --> 11:09.560
And you just said something 
really rude to him!

11:09.560 --> 11:11.560
I'm sorry! Please don't have me 
charged with insulting a noble!

11:11.560 --> 11:13.220
I won't!

11:13.220 --> 11:16.370
You're just one surprise after another, Cain.

11:16.370 --> 11:18.550
How did you get so strong?

11:19.730 --> 11:20.950
<i>I can't tell her</i>

11:21.270 --> 11:24.780
<i>that I was trained by the gods!</i>

11:25.400 --> 11:29.370
Well, you were killing red 
dragons even as a little kid.

11:29.370 --> 11:30.330
Exactly!

11:30.650 --> 11:33.770
Red dragons? Those are SS-rank level.

11:34.150 --> 11:35.670
You're taking out some real beasts.

11:36.050 --> 11:39.190
And he gave me this magic bag!

11:40.310 --> 11:41.130
Me, too.

11:41.130 --> 11:42.670
Hang on a second!

11:42.670 --> 11:46.180
What is that? You got it from Cain? 
How much does it hold?

11:46.180 --> 11:49.330
Uh... How much, actually?

11:49.330 --> 11:52.190
Mine's never been full, so I'm not sure.

11:54.250 --> 11:56.110
Cain...

11:56.420 --> 11:58.490
Tell me the truth.

11:58.490 --> 12:00.560
Where did those things come from?

12:00.560 --> 12:02.580
I made them.

12:02.580 --> 12:05.490
And how much do they actually hold?

12:05.490 --> 12:07.650
Uh... well...

12:07.650 --> 12:10.990
Cain told us that a mansion 
would fit in them.

12:10.990 --> 12:13.490
Th-That makes them...

12:13.490 --> 12:15.260
national treasure class?!

12:15.260 --> 12:16.470
Cain!

12:16.470 --> 12:19.340
How are you able to make something like that?

12:19.340 --> 12:22.950
Our bags don't hold very much at all.

12:22.950 --> 12:27.550
Okay, I understand! 
I'd be happy to make one for you!

12:27.550 --> 12:29.850
Thank you, Cain!

12:29.850 --> 12:31.100
Thank...

12:31.100 --> 12:33.320
H-Huh?!

12:33.320 --> 12:36.390
Sorry about that. Lina can't hold her liquor.

12:36.390 --> 12:39.940
Don't worry. She won't remember 
any of this tomorrow.

12:41.380 --> 12:43.250
So by tomorrow...

12:44.960 --> 12:48.200
I forgot! I have school tomorrow!

12:48.200 --> 12:49.140
School?

12:49.140 --> 12:50.920
I don't have time for this!

12:50.920 --> 12:55.360
I took all of last week off! 
I have to be there this week!

12:55.360 --> 13:01.120
Why does a noble with his own 
domain need to go to school?

13:01.600 --> 13:03.670
Don't you feel like you don't fit in?

13:03.900 --> 13:04.990
Gurk...

13:04.990 --> 13:06.800
Well, yes, I do...

13:06.800 --> 13:13.220
But there's still a lot I don't know, 
so I think... I need to study...

13:13.220 --> 13:14.450
Cain.

13:15.170 --> 13:16.310
Good boy.

13:17.020 --> 13:18.610
I'll give you a hug.

13:19.150 --> 13:21.980
I-I've gotta get to school!

13:21.980 --> 13:24.880
He's definitely having a rough time.

13:24.880 --> 13:27.950
If only we could do something for him...

13:28.950 --> 13:31.160
Retia? What's up?

13:31.550 --> 13:34.770
Well, the instructor who 
was supposed to teach

13:34.770 --> 13:38.170
an adventuring class tomorrow 
for a quest is injured,

13:38.600 --> 13:41.070
so we're looking for a 
last-minute substitute.

13:41.380 --> 13:46.350
A substitute... at the school? Hmm...

13:46.700 --> 13:47.220
Retia!

13:47.850 --> 13:50.930
Could you tell me a bit more about this?

13:57.050 --> 13:59.400
Our magic class will now begin.

13:59.620 --> 14:03.740
Hit the targets with whatever 
spell you think you're best at.

14:03.740 --> 14:04.780
Yes, ma'am.

14:04.780 --> 14:07.620
If you do anything wrong, 
I'll tell you once everyone is done.

14:07.620 --> 14:11.530
Okay, here we go! I'll show her 
what training with Yuuya taught me!

14:11.830 --> 14:14.490
But first, is Cain von Silford here?

14:14.730 --> 14:15.540
Yes, ma'am!

14:15.540 --> 14:19.630
You are forbidden from using 
attack magic on school grounds.

14:19.630 --> 14:21.000
You will only observe this lesson.

14:21.420 --> 14:22.090
What?!

14:22.440 --> 14:25.970
All teachers in the academy 
have been notified of this.

14:26.300 --> 14:30.680
Even your beginner-level magic is 
more than the barrier can handle.

14:30.720 --> 14:32.550
You're kidding!

14:32.550 --> 14:37.250
The headmaster told me to just go ahead 
and give you the credit for this class,

14:37.250 --> 14:39.460
so you don't need to worry about anything.

14:40.900 --> 14:43.850
Cain really doesn't fit 
in with the rest of them.

14:43.850 --> 14:45.280
I'm worried about him.

14:45.280 --> 14:46.650
Poor thing.

14:46.970 --> 14:50.110
I guess it's up to us to give him a hand.

14:50.530 --> 14:52.870
Ready? We'll do as we discussed.

14:53.240 --> 14:54.300
Roger!

14:57.540 --> 14:59.410
I'm Bogan, your adventuring teacher.

14:59.410 --> 15:02.110
I specialize as a vanguard swordsman.

15:02.490 --> 15:05.380
I've asked an adventurer from 
the guild to join us today.

15:09.330 --> 15:10.220
Claude!

15:10.680 --> 15:12.340
Oh! I know them!

15:12.340 --> 15:15.060
They're from Ice Flame. 
That's his partner, Lina.

15:15.060 --> 15:17.640
Their aura is totally different 
from the other two.

15:18.050 --> 15:22.630
The plan was to have a 
C-rank adventurer come,

15:22.630 --> 15:25.040
but the adventurers' guild did us a favor.

15:25.040 --> 15:27.650
These are A-rankers Claude and Lina,

15:25.040 --> 15:27.800
<b>A-rank</b>

15:27.650 --> 15:32.610
and these are B-rankers Millie and Nina. 
They're here to teach you today.

15:28.300 --> 15:32.610
<b>B-rank</b>

15:34.320 --> 15:37.790
<i>They should've told me yesterday 
that they were coming.</i>

15:38.300 --> 15:41.450
How many of you are registered adventurers?

15:41.450 --> 15:42.870
Me! Me! Me!

15:42.870 --> 15:47.280
All of you, huh? Makes sense that you 
chose the adventuring course, then.

15:47.280 --> 15:50.630
Okay! Anyone who has a 
guild card, let's see it.

15:50.630 --> 15:51.730
Huh?!

15:54.070 --> 15:55.140
What's wrong?

15:55.400 --> 15:58.220
Do you not have a guild card?

15:58.220 --> 15:59.930
C'mon, take it out.

16:00.260 --> 16:04.480
<i>Claude! Everyone in here is newly registered!</i>

16:04.480 --> 16:08.070
<i>If I just whip out my gold card right now...</i>

16:08.070 --> 16:11.370
What?! How do you have a gold card?!

16:11.370 --> 16:14.600
<i>They'll be even more put off!</i>

16:14.600 --> 16:17.580
What's wrong, little boy? Where's your card?

16:23.390 --> 16:24.970
I forgot it.

16:25.330 --> 16:26.670
Are you serious?

16:26.670 --> 16:27.610
Yes.

16:27.610 --> 16:30.170
I see. Can't help that, then.

16:30.490 --> 16:34.000
But from now on, keep it 
with you at all times.

16:34.000 --> 16:36.760
It'll serve as your ID if anything happens.

16:37.550 --> 16:39.890
Make absolutely sure you don't forget it.

16:40.700 --> 16:43.020
Did you see how they all looked at him?

16:43.500 --> 16:46.220
Cain really is pretty heavily isolated.

16:46.220 --> 16:47.200
This'll be tough.

16:47.200 --> 16:49.320
We'll have to use our trump card.

16:52.940 --> 16:55.240
Let's get right into the mock battles.

16:55.240 --> 16:58.860
The most basic element of these battles 
is physical enhancement, or Boost.

16:58.860 --> 17:00.890
Make sure you learn it.

17:00.890 --> 17:02.790
We'll start with whoever is ready.

17:02.790 --> 17:03.630
Me!

17:03.630 --> 17:05.060
Let me go first, please!

17:05.060 --> 17:06.080
And me!

17:06.080 --> 17:09.380
Everyone else, please stand 
back a bit and wait your turn.

17:09.640 --> 17:10.300
All right!

17:10.540 --> 17:14.490
I can show at least a little bit of what 
I can really do if I'm fighting Claude!

17:16.260 --> 17:17.680
Thank you, sir!

17:18.280 --> 17:19.260
Okay, I'll go next—

17:19.260 --> 17:20.350
My turn!

17:20.350 --> 17:22.560
Okay, come at me!

17:22.840 --> 17:23.930
Here I go!

17:24.480 --> 17:25.690
Well, then, Lina...

17:26.010 --> 17:27.400
We're using magic only.

17:27.830 --> 17:30.900
You're not allowed to use attack magic.

17:35.930 --> 17:38.420
I'm missing out on the mock battles...

17:38.420 --> 17:40.910
This is just like how things always go.

17:41.890 --> 17:42.790
<i>Cain...</i>

17:43.160 --> 17:45.340
<i>It's not your time yet.</i>

17:45.340 --> 17:49.650
<i>We need to show the students 
how strong we are first.</i>

17:49.650 --> 17:52.440
<i>Then, once we've built up 
some anticipation, you're up.</i>

17:52.760 --> 17:55.150
<i>If you can prove an even match for us...</i>

17:55.510 --> 18:00.160
<i>They'll be so stunned by your strength 
that by the time this lesson's over...</i>

18:00.870 --> 18:03.280
<i>You'll be the hero of the whole class!</i>

18:03.870 --> 18:06.910
<i>Darn it, we're gonna run out of time!</i>

18:06.910 --> 18:08.120
Thank you, sir!

18:08.120 --> 18:09.370
<i>Fidget, fidget...</i>

18:08.370 --> 18:09.090
Who's next?

18:09.090 --> 18:10.310
Me! Me!

18:09.370 --> 18:10.310
Me, please!

18:10.630 --> 18:12.250
What? Why?

18:12.730 --> 18:14.470
No cutting in line.

18:14.470 --> 18:16.860
Wh-What?!

18:16.860 --> 18:18.590
Thank you, sir!

18:18.590 --> 18:19.270
Next!

18:19.270 --> 18:19.820
Yes, sir!

18:20.090 --> 18:20.820
Next!

18:20.820 --> 18:21.780
Is it my turn yet?

18:22.030 --> 18:22.630
Next!

18:22.630 --> 18:23.320
Yes, sir!

18:23.320 --> 18:24.240
Almost...

18:24.240 --> 18:24.890
Next!

18:24.890 --> 18:25.450
Yes, sir!

18:25.710 --> 18:27.130
<i>Hurry! Hurry!</i>

18:27.130 --> 18:27.960
Next!

18:27.960 --> 18:28.550
Yes, sir!

18:28.550 --> 18:29.580
<i>Just one more!</i>

18:32.410 --> 18:33.780
Finally!

18:35.550 --> 18:36.260
Let's go!

18:36.260 --> 18:36.800
Right!

18:43.430 --> 18:44.260
Stop!

18:44.530 --> 18:47.430
What?! Wait a minute, please! 
I still haven't...

18:47.430 --> 18:51.560
Yes, but this class period is over.

18:51.770 --> 18:54.730
Sorry, Cain. I got the time allotment wrong.

18:54.730 --> 18:56.620
Next time! Next time we're here, okay?

18:56.620 --> 18:58.350
There won't be a next time.

18:58.350 --> 19:01.910
Calling in special teachers for adventuring 
is off our schedule for a while.

19:02.350 --> 19:03.760
Why?!

19:03.760 --> 19:05.820
We don't have the budget.

19:05.820 --> 19:09.040
Repairing the damage you did 
cost us a lot of money.

19:10.150 --> 19:13.090
Everyone, be sure to thank 
Claude and the others.

19:13.090 --> 19:15.040
Thank you very much!

19:15.790 --> 19:17.010
No way...

19:17.520 --> 19:18.720
Claude!

19:19.330 --> 19:20.430
Well, bye!

19:24.140 --> 19:27.310
Claude, you... Claude, you...

19:31.230 --> 19:33.310
Claude, you...

19:34.890 --> 19:36.320
Claude, you...

19:41.600 --> 19:46.200
Claude, you jerk!

19:49.070 --> 19:50.930
Whoa! Bad news!

19:50.930 --> 19:54.330
The Prince of Darkness! 
It's the Prince of Darkness!

19:59.670 --> 20:01.300
Oh, gods...

20:01.300 --> 20:03.130
Hurry! Don't fall behind!

20:03.130 --> 20:06.030
Follow me! It's the Prince of Darkness!

20:06.030 --> 20:08.100
Follow me! Follow me!

20:10.670 --> 20:12.230
I feel better now.

20:13.820 --> 20:17.050
Follow me! Follow me! Follow me!

20:20.740 --> 20:22.450
What is this?!

20:23.200 --> 20:24.760
A hole?!

20:32.780 --> 20:33.870
Cain...

20:34.160 --> 20:38.070
I received an urgent message from 
Garm as he was returning to Gracia.

20:38.460 --> 20:41.340
He said the Prince of Darkness 
appeared in the Forest of Monsters.

20:41.930 --> 20:43.520
The forest was razed,

20:43.520 --> 20:46.900
burning rocks rained down from the sky,

20:46.900 --> 20:49.970
and several large craters 
were left in the ground.

20:50.500 --> 20:54.310
Cain, did you not receive a warning 
from the gods as their Chosen?

20:54.310 --> 20:56.400
Uh... No, not really...

20:56.650 --> 20:59.590
Your Majesty, this is a 
disaster for our kingdom.

20:59.590 --> 21:02.570
It may become necessary to 
work with other nations...

21:02.570 --> 21:05.380
No! I don't think we need to do that!

21:05.380 --> 21:06.610
What makes you think that?

21:06.820 --> 21:09.590
Uh... well... just a hunch...

21:09.590 --> 21:10.660
Cain.

21:10.660 --> 21:14.080
Are you hiding something from me?

21:14.080 --> 21:15.540
Uh, no...

21:17.350 --> 21:18.580
Cain!

21:19.690 --> 21:21.350
Your Majesty!

21:21.350 --> 21:25.470
I'm sorry! That was...

21:39.680 --> 21:41.610
The seal has weakened, has it?

21:44.610 --> 21:47.680
It's still just one part of my body...

21:48.190 --> 21:50.300
But I suppose it'll have to do.

21:51.000 --> 21:51.830
Just watch,

21:52.670 --> 21:54.330
you old geezers!

23:26.500 --> 23:28.260
You know what this means, don't you?!

23:28.260 --> 23:29.780
Yes...

23:28.260 --> 23:31.020
I told you not to make me 
keep nagging you about this,

23:31.020 --> 23:34.410
and you're making me nag you again!

23:31.840 --> 23:34.410
Sorry...

23:34.990 --> 23:36.470
<b>Preview</b>

23:36.020 --> 23:38.180
Next time, "Omen of an Onslaught"!

23:36.870 --> 23:40.250
<b>"Omen of an Onslaught"</b>

23:38.180 --> 23:38.690
Ice...

23:38.690 --> 23:39.930
...Flame!
